@startuml
title GET /api/v1/user/{user_id}/assessment-history - Get User Assessment History Flow

start

:Client sends GET /api/v1/user/{user_id}/assessment-history request;

note right
Optional Query Parameters:
- pageNumber: int
- pageSize: int
end note

:JWT Authentication Middleware validates access token;

if (JWT token valid?) then (Yes)

    :Request reaches AssessmentController;

    :Controller validates parameters;

    if (Validation failed?) then (Yes)
        :Return 400 Bad Request;
        stop
    endif

    :Controller forwards request to Mediator;

    :Mediator sends GetUserAssessmentHistoryQuery to Handler;

    :Handler calls AssessmentService;

    :AssessmentService fetches user;

    if (User exists?) then (Yes)

        :AssessmentService retrieves paginated history;

        :Handler maps history to AssessmentHistoryItemDto;

        :Controller returns 200 OK with paginated history;

    else (No)

        :Return 404 Not Found;
        stop

    endif

else (No)

    :Return 401 Unauthorized;

endif

stop

@enduml
